          margin: '0 auto 50px'
        }}>We're always looking for exceptional talent who want to create extraordinary experiences.</p>

        <button style={{
          fontFamily: "'Cinzel', serif",
          fontSize: '14px',
          letterSpacing: '0.15em',
          textTransform: 'uppercase',
